Step 2: Read the size of the array into 'n' and allocate array 'a[n]'[cite: 16].

Step 3: Read 'n' elements into the array using a for loop from index 0 to n - 1[cite: 16]:
        for(i = 0; i < n; i++)[cite: 16]
